<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<databaseChangeLog xmlns="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog"
                   xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                   xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog
                   http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog/dbchangelog-4.20.xsd">

    <changeSet id="029-remove-discord-report-outbox" author="catxi-team">
        <preConditions onFail="HALT"
                       onError="HALT"
                       onFailMessage="report_discord_outbox에 PENDING 또는 FAILED 행이 남아 있습니다. 기존 알림을 처리한 뒤 다시 배포하세요.">
            <tableExists tableName="report_discord_outbox"/>
            <sqlCheck expectedResult="0">
                SELECT COUNT(*)
                FROM report_discord_outbox
                WHERE status &lt;&gt; 'SENT'
            </sqlCheck>
        </preConditions>
        <comment>Discord 신고 알림은 커밋 후 best-effort로 전송하므로 더 이상 아웃박스 테이블을 사용하지 않습니다.</comment>
        <dropTable tableName="report_discord_outbox"/>
    </changeSet>
</databaseChangeLog>
